6. USAGE VERIFICATION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Within fourteen (30) days after Parabol's written request, made no more than
twice in any twelve (12) month period, Licensee will certify in writing the
peak number of Licensed Users during the preceding twelve (12) months. If
usage exceeded the Service Capacity, Licensee will pay for the excess at the
rates in the Self-Hosted Order Form (or, if none are stated, Parabol's
then-current list price), prorated from the date the excess began.

